Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:12.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,My father told me: an exam knows no\Njokes, and results know no forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:18.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Back then, I did not understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,When the sound cut off, focus began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:31.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,But his words never let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.50,0:00:57.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,That day my father smiled and said: the\Nfinal chapter does not like jokes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.50,0:01:03.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your chapter begins tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.50,0:01:12.50,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)}Made with AI (Gemini,\NFLUX.2, Wan 2.2, ACE-Step).\NWords from my father.
